{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12359","headline":"宿毕侍御宅 · 钱起","name":"宿毕侍御宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"交情频更好，子有古人风。\n晤语清霜里，平生苦节同。\n心惟二仲合，室乃一瓢空。\n落叶寄秋菊，愁云低夜鸿。\n薄寒灯影外，残漏雨声中。\n明发南昌去，回看御史骢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12359.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12359","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}